{#
审计助理对话历史的增量摘要: 较早的若干轮问答连同上一份摘要压成一份新摘要 (参考 pi 的 compaction).
变量:
  previous   上一份摘要, 没有为空串
  turns      要压缩的各轮: question, answer, citations (各项 id)
"[Auditor] " 开头的行供 mock 规则模型识别, 勿改格式.
#}
Update the running summary of a conversation between an auditor and the audit assistant. Do not continue the conversation and do not answer any question in it.
{% if previous %}

<previous-summary>
{{ previous }}
</previous-summary>
{% endif %}

<conversation>
{% for turn in turns %}
[Auditor] {{ turn.question }}
[Assistant] {{ turn.answer }}
{% if turn.citations %}
[Cited] {{ turn.citations | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
</conversation>

Write the new summary in the language the auditor used, in at most 400 words, under these headings:
1. Questions the auditor asked
2. Answers and conclusions given, with the IDs cited
3. Follow-ups still open
4. The auditor's stated preferences

Merge everything from the previous summary that is still relevant. Keep IDs, amounts and dates exactly as written. Do not add anything that is not in the conversation.
